{"id":"5325dffa06d7e6a9","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-power-series.md","title":"Power Series","display":"df-power-series — Power Series","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-power-series","aliases":["58-df-power-series","Power Series"],"display":"df-power-series — Power Series","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-convergent-series.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-power-series"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-power-series</span><span>Power Series</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-power-series — Power Series"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6af3724906d8a547\" href=\"?note=6af3724906d8a547\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-convergent-series.md\">../batch05/58-df-convergent-series.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_\\bullet\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\\land z,z_0\\in\\mathbb C\">\\(a_\\bullet\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\\land z,z_0\\in\\mathbb C\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S:\\mathbb C\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb C\">\\(S:\\mathbb C\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb C\\)</span> (partial sum-function determined on the convergence disk)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConvSeries}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ConvSeries}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (convergent-series predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6af3724906d8a547\" href=\"?note=6af3724906d8a547\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-convergent-series.md\">../batch05/58-df-convergent-series.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PowerSeries}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{PowerSeries}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (power-series-at-a-point predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}power\\text{-}series} \\vdash \\mathrm{PowerSeries}_S(S,z,z_0,a_\\bullet) \\leftrightarrow z\\in\\operatorname{dom}(S)\\land \\mathrm{ConvSeries}_S\\bigl(\\langle a_n(z-z_0)^n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle,S(z)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}power\\text{-}series} \\vdash \\mathrm{PowerSeries}_S(S,z,z_0,a_\\bullet) \\leftrightarrow z\\in\\operatorname{dom}(S)\\land \\mathrm{ConvSeries}_S\\bigl(\\langle a_n(z-z_0)^n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle,S(z)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Power series: converges absolutely inside radius of convergence; defines holomorphic function</li>\n<li>If <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}|a_n|/|a_{n+1}|=L\">\\(\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}|a_n|/|a_{n+1}|=L\\)</span>, then <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=L\">\\(R=L\\)</span> when the ratio limit exists.</li>\n<li>Disk of convergence: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D = \\{z : |z - z_0| &lt; R\\}\">\\(D = \\{z : |z - z_0| &lt; R\\}\\)</span>; uniform convergence on compacts</li>\n<li>Differentiation term-by-term: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f&#39;(z) = \\sum_{n=1}^\\infty n a_n (z - z_0)^{n-1}\">\\(f&#39;(z) = \\sum_{n=1}^\\infty n a_n (z - z_0)^{n-1}\\)</span> on same disk</li>\n<li>Uniqueness: if <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum a_n (z-z_0)^n = \\sum b_n (z-z_0)^n\">\\(\\sum a_n (z-z_0)^n = \\sum b_n (z-z_0)^n\\)</span> on nontrivial set, then <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_n = b_n\">\\(a_n = b_n\\)</span></li>\n<li>Abel's theorem: convergence on boundary implies radial limit equals function value</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ahlfors, Complex Analysis</li>\n<li>Rudin, Real and Complex Analysis</li>\n<li>Lang, Complex Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-convergent-series.md","status":"resolved","id":"6af3724906d8a547","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-convergent-series.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-convergent-series.md","status":"resolved","id":"6af3724906d8a547","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ConvSeries}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (convergent-series predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-convergent-series.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a_\\bullet\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\\land z,z_0\\in\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"S:\\mathbb C\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConvSeries}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PowerSeries}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}power\\text{-}series} \\vdash \\mathrm{PowerSeries}_S(S,z,z_0,a_\\bullet) \\leftrightarrow z\\in\\operatorname{dom}(S)\\land \\mathrm{ConvSeries}_S\\bigl(\\langle a_n(z-z_0)^n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle,S(z)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}|a_n|/|a_{n+1}|=L","display":false},{"tex":"R=L","display":false},{"tex":"D = \\{z : |z - z_0| < R\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f'(z) = \\sum_{n=1}^\\infty n a_n (z - z_0)^{n-1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum a_n (z-z_0)^n = \\sum b_n (z-z_0)^n","display":false},{"tex":"a_n = b_n","display":false}],"bytes":1545,"backlinks":[{"id":"689fa138a0ce2d6c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PowerSeries}_S$ (power-series predicate, see [[58-df-power-series]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-973","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-power-series.md|58-df-power-series]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["6af3724906d8a547"]}